-- border + text
|┌───────┐
|│hello  │
|└───────┘
-- rounded, padding
|╭──────╮
|│      │
|│ ab   │
|│      │
|╰──────╯
-- row: grow splits the rest
|+-----++---------+
||a    ||b        |
|+-----++---------+
-- row: fixed + spacer + gap
|L        R
-- column: gap and justify end
|
|
|
|one
|
|two
-- justify between / center cross
|
|x   y   z
|
-- word wrap
|the quick
|brown fox
|
|
